<p>This function clears the command list for a given object
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> WR_ClearAllCommands(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oObject,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> bHardClear&#160;= FALSE<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oObject<dd>the object on which to clear the command list<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">bHardClear<dd>specifies if the object can finish the action in progress or not (Hard = don't wait)
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>TRUE on success, FALSE on failure
